id: pm-csv-rssj
title: Extend measured coverage to every executable TypeScript script and statement dimension
description: "The 2026-09-28 release gate reports 100% lines, branches, and functions over only index.ts and scripts/docstring-gate.ts. This repository has eight scripts/*.ts files plus index.ts; statement coverage is not measured by the Node gate. The current 100% receipt therefore cannot support the requested all-source 100/100/100/100 claim. Package-specific gate configuration and tests must measure every executable source file without exclusions or artificial counters."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-28T15:38:07.333Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-28T15:38:07.333Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Fail closed if any executable TypeScript file is missing from the coverage report; Report and enforce 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines for all executable source"
severity: high
repro_steps: "Run npm run coverage; observe coverage-gate: 2 source files reported and three dimensions, then compare with scripts/*.ts and index.ts."
expected_result: "Every executable TypeScript source and all four coverage dimensions are measured at 100%, with a regression test that fails if a source file is omitted."
actual_result: 2 of 9 source files reported and statement coverage absent.
component: quality-gates
body: ""
